{"id":8867094823111,"title":"Cat Patchwork Quilt Set, Animal Pattern Bedding, Cat Pattern Quilt Set","handle":"cat-patchwork-quilt-set-animal-pattern-bedding-cat-pattern-quilt-set","description":"\u003cp\u003eEmbrace the rustic charm of the countryside with our Farmhouse Quilt Set from Jeminise. This beautiful quilt set brings a cozy, timeless look to any bedroom, featuring classic patterns and soft fabrics. Perfect for adding warmth and tradition, it's also a thoughtful, personalized gift for loved ones on any occasion.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRustic Elegance:\u003c\/strong\u003e Features classic farmhouse patterns and soft, natural fabrics for a cozy, timeless bedroom aesthetic.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePersonalized Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Customize with your preferred size, optional pillowcases, or add a name for a unique touch.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable in Multiple Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Choose from Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80''x90''), Queen (90''x90''), and King (102''x91'').\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eThoughtful Gift:\u003c\/strong\u003e An ideal present for Christmas, New Year, holidays, anniversaries, or birthdays for mom, dad, sister, brother, grandma, grandpa, wife, husband, son, daughter, and other beloved family members.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e Machine washable in cold water and can be air-dried without heat for quick drying and lasting fluffiness.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncluded Components:\u003c\/strong\u003e Each set includes 1 Quilt, with 2 Pillowcases available as an optional addition.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e Crafted from durable and comfortable Polycotton fabric.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eP